    },
    "Translation and explanation": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "অনুবাদ ও ব্যাখ্যা"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translation · %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "অনুবাদ · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translations are shown exactly as published, with their version.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "অনুবাদ যেভাবে প্রকাশিত ঠিক সেভাবেই, সংস্করণসহ দেখানো হয়।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translator's footnotes": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "অনুবাদকের টীকা"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trusted, widely used translations and tafsir. Stories only from narrations graded sahih or hasan. Weak reports and Isra'iliyyat are left out.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "নির্ভরযোগ্য ও বহুল ব্যবহৃত অনুবাদ ও তাফসির। ঘটনা শুধু সহিহ বা হাসান মানের বর্ণনা থেকে। দুর্বল বর্ণনা ও ইসরাইলি রেওয়ায়েত বাদ দেওয়া হয়েছে।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn reminders back on": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "রিমাইন্ডার আবার চালু করুন"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn them on in Settings to get your daily ayah. Your ayahs are always here too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "প্রতিদিনের আয়াত পেতে সেটিংস থেকে চালু করুন। আপনার আয়াতগুলো এখানেও সবসময় আছে।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We check everything with care, but we are human. If you find a mistake, tap Report a mistake and we will fix it, in sha Allah.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "আমরা সবকিছু যত্ন নিয়ে যাচাই করি, তবে আমরা মানুষ। ভুল পেলে \"ভুল জানান\"-এ চাপুন, ইনশাআল্লাহ আমরা ঠিক করব।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What Ramadan is, why we fast, and the night of Qadr. During Ramadan these come first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "রমাদান কী, কেন আমরা রোযা রাখি, আর কদরের রাত। রমাদানে এগুলো আগে আসবে।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What does your heart need today?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "আজ আপনার মনের কী দরকার?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What does your heart need?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "আপনার মনের কী দরকার?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What next?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "এরপর কী?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What stays on your phone": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "যা আপনার ফোনে থাকে"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What time suits you?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "কোন সময় আপনার জন্য ভালো?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When all ayahs are read": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
